#====================================================================
# DRAFT-ohos-toybox-busybox-gnu-flags
# OHOS toybox/busybox 工具不支持 GNU 长选项与 GNU 特有 flag，上游测试脚本运行期炸
# 触发事件: libdebuginfod/0.195 等多库真机测试 (PR #12349)
#====================================================================

id:                     DRAFT-ohos-toybox-busybox-gnu-flags
trigger_tool:           runtime|test|sh|wc|sort|head|diff
phase:                  testing
error_signature:        Unknown option '--|invalid option -- '|unrecognized option' (test script runtime)

severity:               2
category:               compat, portability, toolchain, toybox, testing
match_keywords:         toybox, busybox, wc --lines, sort --parallel, head --quiet, diff --unified, GNU coreutils, long option, Unknown option, test script
title:                  OHOS toybox/busybox tools reject GNU long options (--lines etc.) in upstream test scripts; rewrite to POSIX short options or prepend GNU coreutils to PATH (coreutils-fmt pattern)

root_cause:             OHOS 用户空间命令由 toybox（部分环境叠加 busybox）提供，仅实现 POSIX/常用短选项子集，不识别 GNU coreutils 长选项与 GNU 特有行为。上游测试脚本按 Linux/glibc 习惯写 GNU flag，构建期可过、测试运行期一调用即报 Unknown option 非零退出，上游测试假失败。

rec_approach:           posix-rewrite-or-gnu-coreutils-path
rec_description:         先逐命令对照 toybox --help 收集缺口清单；缺口少（1-2 处）脚本侧改写为 POSIX 等价短选项（wc --lines→wc -l）；缺口多或无法等价改写时按设备已验证的 coreutils-fmt/9.11 模式打包 GNU 工具到 /data/service/hnp/bin/ 并在测试 job 前置 PATH。禁止超出选项等价改写范围篡改上游脚本。
rec_command:            N=$(wc -l < "$f")  # 或 job 脚本: export PATH=/data/service/hnp/bin:$PATH
rec_auto_fix:           false
rec_impl:               conan-recipe

forbid_1_pattern:        借口测试脚本炸而整体跳过上游测试套件
forbid_1_reason:         选项语法缺口有明确等价改写/工具补齐解法，整体跳过属于测试面无谓缩水
forbid_1_consequence:    rule2/3 归因追问 FAIL；真实平台差异被掩盖未归因

doc_file:                 knowledge/drafts/DRAFT-ohos-toybox-busybox-gnu-flags.md
last_updated:             2026-09-27
source_event:             libdebuginfod/0.195 device test run, PR #12349
draft:                    true
contributor_id:           Ember5843
source_pr:                12349
patches_referenced:       无静态补丁（测试 job / 调用侧改写）

verification_cmd:         conan create . --user=ohpcd --channel=stable -pr:h=ci/conan/profiles/ohos-aarch64 -pr:b=ci/conan/profiles/ohos-aarch64 --build=missing
verification_exit:        0
verification_log:         libdebuginfod/0.195 真机测试全过（2026-09，PR #12349 合入）
verification_evidence:    上游测试脚本在 toybox 环境全过；wc -l 等价改写实测等值
valeus_scope:             OHOS 真机/CI 跑上游 shell 测试套件且脚本含 GNU coreutils 长选项或 GNU 特有 flag 的所有配方；构建期已过、测试期报 Unknown option 的场景

limits:                   只解决选项语法/工具缺口类假失败；musl 行为差异导致的真实断言失败须按 rule2/3 逐条归因；toybox 若未来支持更多长选项则改写分支无害

similar_to:             DRAFT-ohos-toybox-ln-long-option, DRAFT-toybox-diff-e-ed-script, DRAFT-tar-1.35-toybox-touch-nanosecond, E010, E106, E188

metrics_success_count:    1
metrics_fail_count:       0
metrics_confidence:       0.85
metrics_last_used:        2026-09-27
